  m_text: 'Under the bright moonlight, you were slain. By ally or foe? You''ll never
    know now. Or will you? Be it divine intervention or an otherworldly curse, you
    have been given life once more! Or so you had hoped. It appears your soul is
    still clinging to this realm, driven by rage, torment, and an undying desire
    to discover what happened to you.


    Taking the body of those around you shouldn''t
    be much trouble for a restless presence such as yourself. Now! Go find the truth!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
