      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Having escaped that decrepit cemetery crypt, you see a vast graveyard
    in your way. The demonic forces of this world seem to have caught on to your
    return to the land of the living. Do not let them stop you.


    That fire,
    that hunger. Let it loose upon those who would stand in your way. If they pose
    too much of a threat, then take what they value most: their own body. You need
    to keep that body if you want to escape. You''re so close. Get. Out.'
